{"id":"en_the-saltwater-clause","title":"The Saltwater Clause","titleEn":"The Saltwater Clause","description":"Disgraced captain Nikolas sees his life collapse in a single night when his wife and cousin betray him. In one stroke he loses his marriage, his fleet, his license and his good name. Left drowning in debt and barred from the sea that defined him, he must find a way forward from the ruins of everything he once had. The series follows his struggle to rebuild after such a devastating fall. Viewers can follow The Saltwater Clause on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-saltwater-clause/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-saltwater-clause/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Counterattack","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv6t2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-saltwater-clause_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv6t2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-saltwater-clause_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv6t2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-saltwater-clause_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv6t2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-saltwater-clause_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv6t2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-saltwater-clause_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":